  "notes": "USAGE:\n{厚着|あつぎ} is a compound of {厚|あつ}い (thick) and {着|ぎ} (wearing). Used with する as a suru-verb: {厚着|あつぎ}する (to dress warmly).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {厚着|あつぎ}をする (to dress warmly)\n- {厚着|あつぎ}しすぎる (to overdress)\n- {厚着|あつぎ}をさせる (to dress someone warmly)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {厚着|あつぎ}: dressing warmly, wearing heavy layers\n- {薄着|うすぎ}: dressing lightly (antonym)\n- {重|かさ}ね{着|ぎ}: layering, wearing layered clothing",
